671    *         perform cursorpos_pruefen in program (lis_progname) if found.
672                                                       " <=== TR 07.12.1998
673             PERFORM DDOWN_VERGLEICH_DURCHFUEHREN IN PROGRAM (LIS_PROGNAME)
674                                                   IF FOUND USING SAV_FCODE.
