544
545      DATA: BEGIN OF AZ_MCPERIOD,
546              MCPERIOD LIKE MCS0-SPMON,
547            END   OF AZ_MCPERIOD.
548
549      FIELD-SYMBOLS: <AZ_MCPERIOD> STRUCTURE AZ_MCPERIOD
