41       DATA: HA_TABNAME      LIKE DFIES-TABNAME,
42             HA_FIELDNAME    LIKE DFIES-FIELDNAME,
43             HA_FELD(30),
44             HA_LINE         LIKE SY-CUROW,
45             HA_CURSOROFFSET LIKE SY-CUCOL,
46             HA_TABIX        LIKE SY-TABIX,
47             HA_LINKS        LIKE TLINE OCCURS 0 WITH HEADER LINE,
48             HA_DFIES        LIKE DFIES,
49             HA_SUBRC        LIKE SY-SUBRC,
50             HA_TITLE        LIKE DSYST-DOKTITLE,
51             HA_HLP_LINKS    LIKE TLINE OCCURS 0.
52
53     * check flg_vergleich = false.
54     * kein Hilfetext in den Vergleichen
55
56       PERFORM CURSORFELD_ERMITTELN CHANGING HA_TABNAME HA_FIELDNAME.
57
58       PERFORM SPEZIAL_HILFETEXT_ANZEIGEN IN PROGRAM (LIS_PROGNAME)
59                                          CHANGING HA_TABNAME HA_FIELDNAME
60                                          IF FOUND.
61
62       IF NOT HA_TABNAME IS INITIAL AND NOT HA_FIELDNAME IS INITIAL.
