1574                                                 CHANGING SA_KRITERIUMTEXT.
1575   *     Evtl. vorkommendes VLINE durch Leerzeichen ersetzen (PS-IS)
1576         SA_MUSTER = SY-VLINE.              "'| '
1577         TRANSLATE SA_KRITERIUMTEXT USING SA_MUSTER.
1578         IF SA_KRITERIUMTEXT IS INITIAL.
1579           SA_SCRTEXT_LENGTH = 1.
1580         ELSE.
1581           SA_SCRTEXT_LENGTH =
1582           cl_abap_list_utilities=>dynamic_output_length(
