6507   *---------- Schreiben Kennzahl in DATA
6508   *--------- BAPI
6509   * if fields_int-kz_flg_desc = true and
6510   *    fields_int-type <> 'T' and
6511   *   fields_int-type <> 'D'.
6512   *------- Ausgabe des Textes ?
6513   *   clear um_hlp_text.
