6793   *-------- 2. Pruefen fuer einzelne Periode
6794           CLEAR hlp_kennz_plan_sub.
6795           REFRESH hlp_kennz_plan_sub.
6796           LOOP AT int_ex_kennz_plan_sub.
6797             hlp_kennz_plan_sub = int_ex_kennz_plan_sub.
