6815   *-------- 1. Retten INT_EX_KENNZ_SUB
6816   *-------- 2. Pruefen fuer einzelne Periode
6817           CLEAR hlp_kennz_sub.
6818           REFRESH hlp_kennz_sub.
6819           LOOP AT int_ex_kennz_sub.
