6859   *--------- Retten Ist-Daten in hlp_kennz_sub
6860         CLEAR hlp_kennz_sub.
6861         REFRESH hlp_kennz_sub.
6862   *--   Leere Zeilen werden benötigt ???
6863         LOOP AT int_ex_kennz_sub.
6864           hlp_kennz_sub = int_ex_kennz_sub.
6865           APPEND hlp_kennz_sub.
6866         ENDLOOP.
6867       ENDIF.
