1317       MOVE-CORRESPONDING hl_dd01l_wa TO rsttyp_info.
1318       MOVE-CORRESPONDING hl_dd01l_wa TO hierarchie_fcodes.
1319       IF hl_rsttyp_tab-domnm <> hl_rsttyp_tab-tdomnm.
1320   *     Domäne weicht von techn. Domäne ab
