1375   *       FORM HIERARCHIE_TEXT_LESEN                                    *
1376   *---------------------------------------------------------------------*
1377   *       Texte zum Hierarchienamen lesen                               *
1378   *---------------------------------------------------------------------*
1379   *  -->  HL_TRSTHV                                                     *
1380   *  -->  HL_SCRTEXT_S                                                  *
1381   *  -->  HL_SCRTEXT_M                                                  *
1382   *  -->  HL_SCRTEXT_L                                                  *
1383   *---------------------------------------------------------------------*
