159    *---------------------------------------------------------------------*
160    *       FORM MCRMK_MCKZSF_EXPORT                                      *
161    *---------------------------------------------------------------------*
162    *       Exportiert die Merkmals- und Kennzahlsdaten.                  *
163    *---------------------------------------------------------------------*
164    *  -->  ME_SELVS    : Name der Selektionsversion                      *
165    *---------------------------------------------------------------------*
166    form mcrmk_mckzsf_export using me_selvs like mcrsv-selvs.
167      data: me_mcrmk   like mcrmk  occurs 0 with header line.
168      data: me_mckzsf  like mckzsf occurs 0 with header line.
169      data: me_zaehler like sy-tabix.
170
171    * Zunächst alle Merkmale des Standardaufrisses in der Reihenfolge des
172    * Standardaufrisses sichern.
173      me_mcrmk-mandt     = sy-mandt.
174    * me_mcrmk-selvs     = mcsi-selvs.
175      me_mcrmk-selvs     = me_selvs.
176      me_mcrmk-tabname   = tmc4-gstru.
177      loop at std_drilldown.
178        me_mcrmk-zaehl = sy-tabix.
179        if std_drilldown-fcode = con_fcode_aper.
180          read table drilldown_fcodes with key fcode = std_drilldown-fcode.
181          me_mcrmk-fieldname = drilldown_fcodes-ddicfeld.
182        else.
183          me_mcrmk-fieldname = std_drilldown-fieldname.
184        endif.
185        append me_mcrmk.
186      endloop.
187
188    * Zähler initialisieren
189      describe table me_mcrmk lines me_zaehler.
190      me_zaehler = me_zaehler + 1.
191
192    * Dann die restlichen Merkmale in beliebiger Reihefolge sichern.
193      loop at drilldown_fcodes.
194        read table me_mcrmk with key fieldname = drilldown_fcodes-ddicfeld.
195        if sy-subrc <> 0.
196    *     Merkmal war nicht im Standarddrilldown => noch einfügen
197          me_mcrmk-mandt     = sy-mandt.
198    *     me_mcrmk-selvs     = mcsi-selvs.
199          me_mcrmk-selvs     = me_selvs.
200          me_mcrmk-zaehl     = me_zaehler.
201          me_mcrmk-tabname   = gstru.      "Richtig?
202          me_mcrmk-fieldname = drilldown_fcodes-ddicfeld.
203          me_mcrmk-xverdicht = space.
204          me_zaehler         = me_zaehler + 1.
205          append me_mcrmk.
206        endif.
207      endloop.
208
209    * Merkmale auf die Datenbank sichern
210      insert mcrmk from table me_mcrmk.
211
212    * Kennzahlen sichern
213      me_mckzsf-mandt = sy-mandt.
214      me_mckzsf-gstru = gstru.
215      concatenate '~' me_selvs into me_mckzsf-kennzsicht.
216      loop at akt_kennzahlen.
217        me_mckzsf-zaehl     = sy-tabix.
218        me_mckzsf-tabname   = akt_kennzahlen-tabname.
219        me_mckzsf-fieldname = akt_kennzahlen-fieldname.
220        me_mckzsf-factor    = akt_kennzahlen-factor.
221        me_mckzsf-odecimals = akt_kennzahlen-odecimals.
222        append me_mckzsf.
223      endloop.
224
225    * Kennzahlen auf die Datenbank sichern
226      insert mckzsf from table me_mckzsf.
227
228    * Sperre der Selektionsversion wieder aufheben
229      call function 'DEQUEUE_E_MCRSV'
230        exporting
231          selvs = mcrsv-selvs.
232
233    endform.
