559                         exception
560                         from database mcsi(is) id mcsi_key
561                         ACCEPTING PADDING ACCEPTING TRUNCATION.
562              ENDTRY.
563            endif.                                           " <= note 314134
564          endif.
565
566          get run time field sav_duration.
567          if exc_mode = con_exc_mode_bapi.
568    *      Selektionsversion nur für BAPI lesen
569            perform data_bapi in program (lis_progname) if found.
