1849   *       FORM PLANVERSION_PRUEFEN                                      *
1850   *---------------------------------------------------------------------*
1851   *       Prüfroutine für FB POPUP_GET_VALUES_USER_CHECKED              *
1852   *       Prüft, ob die eingegebene Planversion existiert.              *
1853   *---------------------------------------------------------------------*
1854   *  -->  PP_FIELDS                                                     *
1855   *  -->  PP_ERROR                                                      *
1856   *---------------------------------------------------------------------*
1857   FORM PLANVERSION_PRUEFEN TABLES   PP_FIELDS STRUCTURE SVAL
1858                            CHANGING PP_ERROR  STRUCTURE SVALE.
1859
1860   * existiert die eingegebene Version?
1861     READ TABLE PP_FIELDS INDEX 3.
1862     SELECT SINGLE * FROM P44V
1863       WHERE GSTRU = PP_FIELDS-TABNAME
1864         AND SSOUR = SPACE
1865         AND VRSIO = PP_FIELDS-VALUE.
1866     IF SY-SUBRC <> 0.
1867       CLEAR PP_ERROR.
1868   *   "Version & nicht vorhanden"
1869       PP_ERROR-MSGID      = 'M5'.
1870       PP_ERROR-MSGTY      = 'I'.
1871       PP_ERROR-MSGNO      = '013'.
1872       PP_ERROR-MSGV1      = PP_FIELDS-VALUE.
1873       PP_ERROR-ERRORTAB   = PP_FIELDS-TABNAME.
1874       PP_ERROR-ERRORFIELD = PP_FIELDS-FIELDNAME.
1875     ELSE.
1876   *   Berechtigungsprüfung auf Planversion
1877       AUTHORITY-CHECK OBJECT 'M_INFO_MCD'
1878                ID 'ACTVT' FIELD '03'
1879                ID 'GSTRU' FIELD HLP_MCINF
1880                ID 'VRSIO' FIELD PP_FIELDS-VALUE(3)
1881                ID 'SSOUR' DUMMY.
1882       IF SY-SUBRC <> 0.
1883         PP_ERROR-MSGID      = 'M5'.
1884         PP_ERROR-MSGTY      = 'E'.
1885         PP_ERROR-MSGNO      = '066'.
1886         PP_ERROR-MSGV1      = PP_FIELDS-VALUE.
1887         PP_ERROR-ERRORTAB   = PP_FIELDS-TABNAME.
1888         PP_ERROR-ERRORFIELD = PP_FIELDS-FIELDNAME.
1889       ENDIF.
1890     ENDIF.
1891   ENDFORM.                               "PLANVERSION_PRUEFEN
