1895   *       FORM PP_SPBUP_FILL                                            *
1896   *---------------------------------------------------------------------*
1897   *       Abgleich Drilldown-Ranges mit Selektions-Ranges für SPBUP     *
1898   *---------------------------------------------------------------------*
1899   FORM PP_SPBUP_FILL.
1900
1901   * Periode Monat
1902     REFRESH PP_SPBUP.
1903     READ TABLE DD_SPBUP INDEX 1.
1904     IF SY-SUBRC = 0.
1905       PP_SPBUP = DD_SPBUP.
1906       APPEND PP_SPBUP.
1907     ELSE.
1908       LOOP AT SL_SPBUP.
1909         PP_SPBUP = SL_SPBUP.
1910         APPEND PP_SPBUP.
1911       ENDLOOP.
1912     ENDIF.
1913     IF FLG_VERGLEICH = CON_VERGLEICH_VORJAHR.
1914   *   Vorjahresvergleich => Jahreszahl um 1 vermindern
1915       LOOP AT PP_SPBUP.
1916         IF NOT PP_SPBUP-LOW  IS INITIAL.
1917           PP_SPBUP-LOW(4)  = PP_SPBUP-LOW(4) - 1.
1918         ENDIF.
1919         IF NOT PP_SPBUP-HIGH IS INITIAL.
1920           PP_SPBUP-HIGH(4) = PP_SPBUP-HIGH(4) - 1.
1921         ENDIF.
1922         MODIFY PP_SPBUP.
1923       ENDLOOP.
1924     ENDIF.
1925   ENDFORM.                               "PP_SPBUP_FILL
