1954           PP_SPMON-HIGH(4) = PP_SPMON-HIGH(4) - 1.
1955         ENDIF.
1956         MODIFY PP_SPMON.
1957       ENDLOOP.
1958     ENDIF.
1959   ENDFORM.                               "PP_SPMON_FILL
