1021   FORM XXL_MERKMALSTAB_FUELLEN
1022                    CHANGING XF_DATENSPALTEN LIKE XXL_HMERKMALE-COL_NO.
1023
1024     DATA: XF_SUBRC        LIKE SY-SUBRC,
1025           XF_PERIODENFELD LIKE DFIES-FIELDNAME.
1026     DATA: BEGIN OF XF_DFIES.
1027             INCLUDE STRUCTURE DFIES.
1028     DATA: END   OF XF_DFIES.
