1033     REFRESH XXL_VMERKMALE.
1034     CLEAR   XXL_VMERKMALE.
1035     LOOP AT XXL_DATA_MERKMALE.
1036       XXL_VMERKMALE-COL_NO = SY-TABIX.
1037       PERFORM GET_FIELD(RDDFIE00)
1038         using    gstru
