1097             XXL_VMERKMALE-COL_NAME = XF_DFIES-SCRTEXT_S.
1098             APPEND XXL_VMERKMALE.
1099           WHEN 2.
1100   *       Texte nicht gefunden
1101             XF_DFIES-SCRTEXT_S = XXL_DATA_MERKMALE-FIELDNAME.
1102             XF_DFIES-SCRTEXT_M = XXL_DATA_MERKMALE-FIELDNAME.
1103             XF_DFIES-SCRTEXT_L = XXL_DATA_MERKMALE-FIELDNAME.
1104             XF_DFIES-REPTEXT   = XXL_DATA_MERKMALE-FIELDNAME.
1105             XXL_VMERKMALE-COL_NAME = XF_DFIES-SCRTEXT_S.
1106             APPEND XXL_VMERKMALE.
1107           WHEN 4.
