2034   *---------------------------------------------------------------------*
2035   *       FORM PARAMETER_SETZEN_SL                                      *
2036   *---------------------------------------------------------------------*
2037   *       SPA/GPA-Parameter für Stamm-und Belegdatenanzeige werden aus  *
2038   *       den SL...-Tabellen gefüllt.                                   *
2039   *       Vor.: SL...-Tabelle enthält genau einen Eintrag.              *
2040   *---------------------------------------------------------------------*
2041   FORM PARAMETER_SETZEN_SL.
2042     FIELD-SYMBOLS: <PS_SL_RANGES_TAB> TYPE TABLE,
2043                    <PS_SL_RANGES>,
2044                    <PS_SL_RANGES_SIGN>,
2045                    <PS_SL_RANGES_OPTION>,
2046                    <PS_SL_RANGES_LOW>,
2047                    <PS_SL_RANGES_HIGH>.
2048
2049     DATA:          BEGIN OF PS_RANGES OCCURS 20,
2050                     FIELD LIKE DRILLDOWN_FCODES-DOMNAME,
2051                     LOW(32),
2052                     HIGH(32),
2053                     OPTION(4),
2054                     SIGN(2),
2055                    END OF PS_RANGES.
2056     DATA:          PS_FELDNAME(30),
2057                    PS_LINES LIKE SY-TABIX.
2058
2059   * Assign der Kopfleiste von SL_...
2060     CONCATENATE 'SL_' DRILLDOWN_FCODES-RANGES_SUF INTO PS_FELDNAME.
2061     ASSIGN (PS_FELDNAME) TO <PS_SL_RANGES>.
2062   * Assign der Tabelle SL_...
2063     CONCATENATE PS_FELDNAME '[]' INTO PS_FELDNAME.
2064     ASSIGN (PS_FELDNAME) TO <PS_SL_RANGES_TAB>.
2065   * SIGN setzen
2066     ASSIGN COMPONENT 1 OF STRUCTURE <PS_SL_RANGES> TO <PS_SL_RANGES_SIGN>.
2067   * OPTION setzen
2068     ASSIGN COMPONENT 2 OF STRUCTURE <PS_SL_RANGES>
2069       TO <PS_SL_RANGES_OPTION>.
2070   * LOW setzen
2071     ASSIGN COMPONENT 3 OF STRUCTURE <PS_SL_RANGES> TO <PS_SL_RANGES_LOW>.
2072   * HIGH setzen
2073     ASSIGN COMPONENT 4 OF STRUCTURE <PS_SL_RANGES> TO <PS_SL_RANGES_HIGH>.
2074     LOOP AT <PS_SL_RANGES_TAB> INTO <PS_SL_RANGES>.
2075       PS_RANGES-SIGN   = <PS_SL_RANGES_SIGN>.
2076       PS_RANGES-OPTION = <PS_SL_RANGES_OPTION>.
2077       PS_RANGES-LOW    = <PS_SL_RANGES_LOW>.
2078       PS_RANGES-HIGH   = <PS_SL_RANGES_HIGH>.
2079       PS_RANGES-FIELD  = DRILLDOWN_FCODES-DOMNAME.
2080       APPEND PS_RANGES.
2081       DESCRIBE TABLE PS_RANGES LINES PS_LINES.
2082       IF PS_LINES = 1.
2083         READ TABLE PS_RANGES INDEX PS_LINES.
2084         IF PS_RANGES-OPTION = 'EQ' AND PS_RANGES-SIGN = 'I'.
2085           IF DRILLDOWN_FCODES-MEMORYID <> SPACE.
2086             SET PARAMETER ID DRILLDOWN_FCODES-MEMORYID
2087                 FIELD PS_RANGES-LOW.
2088           ENDIF.
2089         ENDIF.
2090       ENDIF.
2091     ENDLOOP.
2092   ENDFORM.                               "PARAMETER_SETZEN_SL
