8162   FORM bestand_zurueckrechnen_ak.
8163
8164     CLEAR xmbew.
8165     LOOP AT int_s032.
8166       IF xmbew-matnr NE int_s032-matnr OR
8167          xmbew-bwkey NE int_s032-werks.
