8244           IF periotab-low IN zeitr.
8245   *         Eintrag in die Int_S000
8246             PERFORM daten_zuweisen.
8247             APPEND int_s000.
8248             CLEAR int_s000.
8249           ENDIF.
8250         ENDIF.
8251       ENDLOOP.
8252     ENDLOOP.
8253   ENDFORM.                               "bestand_zurueckrechnen_ak
